From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nowon <nowon@noreply.pepecoin.surf>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 18:12:21 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 128/144] GreatDANE: relabel the unofficial About Terms link to
 Support (round 4g)

Coordinator ruling: unofficial builds should not keep a "Terms of Use" label
pointing at https://dane.surf/support/ (dane.surf/terms/ is 404). The bottom
link now uses a new Dane-specific Fluent ID, dane-bottom-links-support =
"Support", still pointing at https://dane.surf/support/.

en-US aboutDialog.ftl bottom-links-terms stays "Terms of Use" for official
branding, and the official About link still uses that ID and the Firefox
terms URL.

The unofficial "Get involved!" helpus link also goes to
https://dane.surf/support/, but it does not say Support, so this is not a
duplicated Support label. The donate link stays absent on unofficial builds;
official branding still has helpus with the Foundation donate URL.

Prepared only. Not built, signed, notarized or published.
---
 browser/base/content/aboutDialog.xhtml             | 2 +-
 browser/branding/greatdane/locales/en-US/brand.ftl | 4 ++++
 2 files changed, 5 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/browser/base/content/aboutDialog.xhtml b/browser/base/content/aboutDialog.xhtml
index e930fedaa0..2f31c7f0c5 100644
--- a/browser/base/content/aboutDialog.xhtml
+++ b/browser/base/content/aboutDialog.xhtml
@@ -165,7 +165,7 @@
       <hbox pack="center">
         <label is="text-link" class="bottom-link" useoriginprincipal="true" href="about:license" data-l10n-id="bottomLinks-license"/>
 #ifndef MOZ_OFFICIAL_BRANDING
-        <label is="text-link" class="bottom-link" href="https://dane.surf/support/" data-l10n-id="bottom-links-terms"/>
+        <label is="text-link" class="bottom-link" href="https://dane.surf/support/" data-l10n-id="dane-bottom-links-support"/>
         <label is="text-link" class="bottom-link" href="https://dane.surf/privacy/" data-l10n-id="bottom-links-privacy"/>
 #else
         <label is="text-link" class="bottom-link" href="https://www.mozilla.org/about/legal/terms/firefox/" data-l10n-id="bottom-links-terms"/>
diff --git a/browser/branding/greatdane/locales/en-US/brand.ftl b/browser/branding/greatdane/locales/en-US/brand.ftl
index 567b94a84a..6f1e36125b 100644
--- a/browser/branding/greatdane/locales/en-US/brand.ftl
+++ b/browser/branding/greatdane/locales/en-US/brand.ftl
@@ -41,3 +41,7 @@ dane-community-2 = { -brand-short-name } is built from Mozilla's open source Fir
 # Unofficial About "Want to help?" line. Official branding keeps helpus, including
 # the donate link. Dane has no donate page, so unofficial builds drop it.
 dane-helpus = Want to help? <label data-l10n-name="helpus-getInvolvedLink">Get involved!</label>
+
+# Unofficial About bottom link, in place of stock "Terms of Use" (dane.surf has
+# no /terms page). Official branding keeps bottom-links-terms = Terms of Use.
+dane-bottom-links-support = Support
